# Force HTTPS: instruct browsers to only ever connect over TLS (mirrors the
# marketing site). The HTTP→HTTPS redirect itself is the Cloudflare zone
# "Always Use HTTPS" setting.
#
# Content-Security-Policy (2026-10-12) — ENFORCED. What the app really reaches
# for, and nothing else:
#   • script-src: its own bundle; the one inline script in index.html (the
#     pre-paint theme), allowed by its hash — change that script and the hash
#     must change with it (`npm run test:theme` checks); Google's sign-in
#     script (the SDK loads accounts.google.com/gsi/client on demand).
#     No 'unsafe-inline' and no 'unsafe-eval'.
#   • style-src 'unsafe-inline': React style attributes, everywhere.
#   • font-src 'self': Inter is served from this site (src/assets/fonts), not
#     Google Fonts.
#   • connect-src: Supabase (database, auth, edge functions, realtime chat),
#     LiveKit Cloud (the live room's signalling, wss:// and https://), the R2
#     hosted-files Worker (replay uploads), the suite changelog, Google
#     sign-in. A self-hosted copy on its own LiveKit server must add its host.
#   • media-src: the live room's tracks and the host's own recording are
#     blob:/MediaStream; a replay streams from a signed R2 (Worker) or
#     Supabase Storage link.
#   • frame-src: a shared PDF opens in the browser's viewer from a signed
#     Supabase Storage link; Google sign-in.
#   • worker-src 'self' blob:: the service worker, and the recorder's frame
#     clock (a blob: worker).
#   • img-src https:: avatars, organisation logos and shared images.
#   • No Cloudflare Web Analytics. Cloudflare's zone-level automatic setup
#     injects its beacon (static.cloudflareinsights.com) into the live HTML;
#     this policy refuses it. Turn the injection off for this host in
#     Cloudflare (Web Analytics site rules).
# The dev server serves the same policy Report-Only (vite.config.ts, cspDev()).
#
# Hardening. Nothing in the suite frames this app, so refusing to be framed
# elsewhere costs nothing and closes off click-jacking. No Permissions-Policy:
# hosts and speakers need the camera, the microphone and screen sharing.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
